# --- Build artifacts / user data (safe to ignore) ---
App/build
App/Pods
App/output
DerivedData
xcuserdata
*.xcuserstate

# NOTE (intentionally committed so the project opens & runs after clone):
#   App/App/public                      -> bundled web build
#   App/App/capacitor.config.json       -> runtime Capacitor config
#   App/App/config.xml                  -> Cordova compat config
#   capacitor-cordova-ios-plugins       -> Capacitor/Cordova plugin bridge
# These are normally regenerated by `npx cap sync ios`, but we keep them in git
# so a fresh clone is Xcode-ready after only `yarn install`.
